t with the unlockable creator ghost.","Read the development disclosure, then inspect movement, lap timing, and replay storage.","Change a track or handling parameter and complete a validation run before saving.","AI workflow / foundation context","Kecksdose names OpenCode as the coding tool and GPT 5.2 Codex as the model. The README publishes a short development disclosure, rather than the original prompts or full conversation.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Engine","Pygame 2.6 · Python","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[132,133,134,135],{"_58":127,"_25":99,"_17":122},{"_58":116,"_25":117,"_17":111,"_100":118},{"_58":107,"_25":108,"_161":162,"_100":109},{"_58":98,"_25":99,"_100":101},[160],"opencode","scope","complete-project",{"_164":165},"documents",{"_166":167,"_168":169},"en",[171,175,176,177,174,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,173,210,172,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231],"zh",[170,171,172,173,174],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","c